      "side": 1,
      "message": "It isn\u0027t yet, but I plan to do so in order to selectively enforce capabilities depending on which Android version the device first shipped with.\n\nIt will look something like...\n\n static bool activateWorkaround(int androidAPILevel) {\n  #if defined(SK_BUILD_FOR_ANDROID) \u0026\u0026 defined(SK_BUILD_FOR_SKQP)\n    // run some logic comparing the androidAPILevel to the system property\n  #else\n    return true;\n  #endif\n }",
